---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the Curious Mind creative archive.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About me</p>
      <h1>Hey! Welcome to my crazy little world.</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">I’m Niran: a school student, creator, explorer, gamer, dinosaur fan, and professional question-asker.</p>
      <p>I’m curious about pretty much everything. Sometimes I ask so many questions that even Google might need a break.</p>
      <p>When I’m not busy with school, you’ll probably find me watching anime, playing games, building paper airplanes, making random things, or wondering why dinosaurs were so ridiculously cool.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="portrait">
      <img src="/images/about/niran.png" alt="Niran smiling at his desk with books and a laptop" fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>Always making, learning, or asking one more question.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section what-section" aria-labelledby="what-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">The archive</p>
      <h2 id="what-title">What’s on this website?</h2>
      <p>This is my creative playground: a place for things I make and discover.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="interest-list">
      <li><span class="interest-number">01</span><span><strong>Comics</strong><small>Stories created straight from my imagination.</small></span><a href="/comics/" aria-label="Explore comics">↗</a></li>
      <li><span class="interest-number">02</span><span><strong>Photos</strong><small>Cool, funny, weird, or interesting things I’ve captured.</small></span><a href="/photos/" aria-label="Explore photos">↗</a></li>
      <li><span class="interest-number">03</span><span><strong>Small projects</strong><small>Experiments and things I decided to build just because I could.</small></span><a href="/projects/" aria-label="Explore projects">↗</a></li>
      <li><span class="interest-number">04</span><span><strong>Fun videos</strong><small>Interesting things I discover along the way.</small></span><a href="/videos/" aria-label="Explore videos">↗</a></li>
      <li><span class="interest-number">05</span><span><strong>Amazing facts</strong><small>Weird, surprising, and “WAIT… REALLY?!” facts.</small></span><span class="coming-soon">More soon</span></li>
      <li><span class="interest-number">06</span><span><strong>Paper craft</strong><small>Because folding paper into something that flies never gets boring.</small></span><span class="coming-soon">More soon</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="why-section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why I made this</p>
    <h2 id="why-title">Creating beats just scrolling.</h2>
    <p>I made this website to share my ideas, show what I’m working on, learn new things, and hopefully make you smile, laugh, or say:</p>
    <p class="quote">“Whoa… I didn’t know that!”</p>
    <p>Explore around, read a comic, watch a video, discover something strange, and maybe learn something new.</p>
    <p class="signoff">Stay curious. Keep creating. Never trust a dinosaur.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero { display: grid; min-height: 620px; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(300px, 0.82fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 120px); padding: 72px 10vw 96px; }
  .about-copy { max-width: 650px; }
  .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 28px; font-size: 4.75rem; }
  .about-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 570px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .about-copy .about-lead { color: var(--color-text-primary); font: 400 1.5rem/1.35 var(--font-display); }
  .portrait { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 520px; justify-self: end; margin: 0; padding: 18px; background: var(--color-accent-yellow); transform: rotate(1.5deg); }
  .portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; max-height: 620px; aspect-ratio: 0.9; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 42%; }
  .portrait figcaption { padding: 12px 4px 0; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); }
  .about-section { padding: 88px 10vw 100px; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 8px 40px; margin-bottom: 38px; }
  .section-heading .eyebrow { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 3.75rem; }
  .section-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 360px; justify-self: end; margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .interest-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .interest-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .interest-number { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); }
  .interest-list li > span:nth-child(2) { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .interest-list strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .interest-list small { color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); }
  .interest-list a { font-size: 1.2rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .coming-soon { color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-size-xs); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .why-section { padding: 84px 10vw 96px; background: var(--color-text-primary); color: var(--color-background); }
  .why-section h2 { max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .why-section > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 650px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); line-height: 1.7; }
  .why-section .quote { margin: 24px 0; color: var(--color-accent-yellow); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 2rem; }
  .why-section .signoff { margin-top: 32px; color: var(--color-accent-yellow); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); }
  .interest-list a:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }
  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    h1 { font-size: 3.75rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 3rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-hero { min-height: 0; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding: 58px 8vw 68px; }
    h1 { font-size: 3.25rem; }
    .portrait { width: min(100%, 420px); justify-self: center; }
    .portrait img { max-height: 520px; }
    .about-section { padding: 66px 8vw 76px; }
    .section-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
    .section-heading > p:last-child { justify-self: start; }
    .interest-list li { grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 12px; }
    .interest-list strong { font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .why-section { padding: 66px 8vw 76px; }
  }
</style>
